<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Yamaha Sirius vs Honda Click: Hanoi Rental Cost Comparison</h1>
<p>Brand loyalty usually carries a price, but not in this corner of the Hanoi rental market. The Yamaha Sirius and the Honda Click, one a semi-automatic underbone and the other a fully automatic scooter, rent at exactly the same verified rates for every rental period on the list. This comparison treats that fact as its starting point and works out what actually separates the two machines.</p>
<p>This guide sets out the verified prices for both models, explains why two competing brands share a tier, compares the riding experience of each format in Hanoi traffic, and adds up the running costs beyond the rental rate. It connects to the guide to <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a>, the main <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> resource, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>. With the money equal, the choice is about how you want to ride.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">Two brands in one price tier</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">Verified rental prices for both models</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">What identical pricing tells you</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Riding the Yamaha Sirius in Hanoi</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Riding the Honda Click in Hanoi</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Fuel economy and running costs</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-7">Choosing between the two</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-8">Booking and confirming current rates</a></li>
